== 5. Within cutaneous melanomas only ========================== 
  Restricting to cutaneous cases removes acral and mucosal entirely, 
  so any surviving gradient cannot be a site effect between those 
  groups. It costs sample size. 
  NOTE: this subset is skin of unspecified type. It is not verified 
  to exclude acral melanoma, because the metadata cannot identify 
  acral cases at all. 
